{
  "item": "mirazu",
  "mu_name": "Mirage",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/mirazu.bmd, loaded as MODEL_CURSEDTEMPLE_ENTER_NPC (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2056-2058, its textures out of Npc\\), MuMain's MONSTER_MIRAGE, the Illusion Temple's gatekeeper (w_CursedTemple.cpp:208-213). Not Version075's.",
  "world": "lorencia",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "The Broker (docs/broker.md, sim::kBroker): the user's pick on 2026-10-11 from a contact sheet of sixteen unused MuMain NPC models. A grey-haired man in spectacles, a red coat over leather and a book at his side: 1708 triangles on three sheets, 42 bones, two idles. The same figure in Lorencia, Devias and Noria, so the market reads as one.",
  "scale": 0.95,
  "scale_from": "CreateCharacter stands him at `pCharacter->Object.Scale = 0.95f` (w_CursedTemple.cpp:212), MU's own; carried as the figure's scale (index.py's npc row, the cook's standalone entry, FigureBody::scale).",
  "actions_from": "Two idles, both kept (export-rig --actions=all). MuMain throws cloud particles off bone 1 in his second idle (w_CursedTemple.cpp:761-775); not drawn.",
  "profile": "npc",
  "sheets": {
    "mirazu01": "npc_mirazu01.png",
    "mirazu022": "npc_mirazu022.png",
    "eyeglas_R": "npc_eyeglas_r.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Out of Data/NPC, beside the model, decoded under an npc_ prefix.",
  "sheet_materials": {
    "mirazu01": "skin",
    "mirazu022": "cloth",
    "eyeglas_R": "glass"
  },
  "sheet_materials_from": "mirazu01 is the one page of his face, coat, leather and book, so skin, as every townsperson's shared page is; mirazu022 is his cape's fringe, red cloth fraying to white; eyeglas_R is the lens of his spectacles, which MU draws added (the _R).",
  "cutout": [
    "mirazu022"
  ],
  "cutout_alpha": [
    "mirazu022"
  ],
  "cutout_from": "mirazu022.OZT carries a real alpha, and it is the fringe's ragged edge: 12% cut away. Keyed off that alpha.",
